888--- @field #list<#TravelDestination> travelDestinations A list of @{#TravelDestination}s for this creature.
889--- @field #boolean canFly whether the creature can fly
890--- @field #boolean canSwim whether the creature can swim
891--- @field #boolean canWalk whether the creature can walk
892--- @field #boolean canUseWeapons whether the creature can use weapons and shields
